/-- isOwner(a). Success needs: no value, 36 bytes of call data, and an argument word with no dirty bits above the address. Then: returns 1 when `a` is the address in slot 0, else 0 (it tests its ARGUMENT, not the caller); no slot changes; no log. -/
theorem isOwner_readable (hfork : .berlin ≤ fork)
    (hsize' : message.data.size < 2 ^ 256)
